<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Bhumika Vlogs</title>

  <style>
    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #fff7f2;
      color: #333;
    }

    header {
      background: #ff7b72;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 30px 15px;
    }

    header h1 {
      font-size: 32px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    header p {
      font-size: 16px;
    }

    nav {
      background: white;
      padding: 15px;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: 0 2px 8px #ddd;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #ff5f56;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin: 0 12px;
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .hero {
      text-align: center;
      padding: 50px 20px;
    }

    .hero h2 {
      font-size: 28px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 17px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .btn {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-top: 25px;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      background: #ff7b72;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
    }

    .section {
      padding: 35px 20px;
      max-width: 900px;
      margin: auto;
    }

    .section h2 {
      text-align: center;
      margin-bottom: 25px;
      color: #ff5f56;
    }

    .card {
      background: white;
      padding: 22px;
      margin-bottom: 18px;
      border-radius: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 3px 12px #ddd;
    }

    .card h3 {
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    footer {
      background: #333;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 25px;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <header>
    <h1>🌸 Bhumika Vlogs 🌸</h1>
    <p>My Daily Life • My Journey • My Memories</p>
  </header>

  <nav>
    <a href="#home">Home</a>
    <a href="#vlogs">Vlogs</a>
    <a href="#about">About Me</a>
  </nav>

  <section class="hero" id="home">
    <h2>Welcome to My World ❤️</h2>
    <p>
      Hello! Main Bhumika hoon. 
      Yahan main apni daily life, experiences aur special moments share karungi.
    </p>

    <a class="btn" href="#vlogs">My Vlogs</a>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="vlogs">
    <h2>🎥 My Latest Vlogs</h2>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🌱 A Day in My Life</h3>
      <p>My simple daily routine and beautiful little moments.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>📚 Study & Life</h3>
      <p>Study time, goals and my journey towards my dreams.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h3>🏡 Village Life</h3>
      <p>Simple village life, nature and everyday memories.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="about">
    <h2>💗 About Me</h2>

    <div class="card">
      <p>
        Hi! I'm Bhumika. Welcome to my little corner of the internet.
        This website is where I will share my life, memories and journey.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2026 Bhumika Vlogs ❤️</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
